# Normalise line endings in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# This is not cosmetic. Git's core.autocrlf defaults to true on the GitHub
# Windows runners, so without this file a Windows checkout converts every LF to
# CRLF — and gofmt then reports every .go file as unformatted. That is exactly
# how CI failed on its first run: gofmt passed on Linux and macOS, failed on
# Windows, and skipped Build/Vet/Test behind it.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows shell scripts want CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never rewrite.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.so    binary
*.dylib binary
